            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kalıcı bir yeniden yönlendirme için durum kodunu ayarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"301\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"302\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>301</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eski bir rotayı kalıcı olarak güncel rotaya yönlendirerek çalışır durumda tut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"get\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/legacy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"redirect\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"301\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;/current&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"302\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>301</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
